Task 1: Compare Monolithic and Microservice Architectures
Subtask 1.1: Document Architectural Characteristics
Step 1: Create a Comparison Document
cat > architecture-comparison.md << 'EOF'
# Architecture Comparison Study

## Monolithic Architecture
- Single deployable unit
- Shared database
- Internal method calls (in-process)
- Technology stack uniformity
- Centralized logging and monitoring

## Microservice Architecture
- Multiple independently deployable services
- Service-specific databases
- Network-based communication (REST, gRPC, messaging)
- Technology diversity across services
- Distributed logging and monitoring
EOF

cat architecture-comparison.md
